{"branch":"명일점","html":"<p class=\"kd-intro\">명일점의 위치와 주변 교통편을 확인하세요.</p><div class=\"kd-map-slot\" data-kakao-src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-c0baa54782eb99dc.html\" style=\"height:398px\"><p class=\"kd-map-pending\" role=\"status\">위치 지도를 준비하고 있습니다.</p><template><iframe class=\"kd-map-frame\" width=\"640\" height=\"398\" style=\"height:398px\" loading=\"lazy\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" title=\"명일점 카카오맵 지도\" src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-c0baa54782eb99dc.html\"></iframe></template></div><noscript><style>.kd-map-slot{display:none}</style><p class=\"kd-note\">위의 지도 이미지와 아래 주소를 기준으로 위치를 확인해 주세요.</p></noscript><p class=\"kd-address\"><strong>주소</strong><span>서울 강동구 양재대로 1606 3층</span></p><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 지하철</h3><ul class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-line\">수도권 5호선</span><span>명일역</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-line\">수도권 5호선</span><span>굽은다리역</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 정류장</h3><ol class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-number\">1</span><span>명일역1번출구.명일전통시장</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">2</span><span>봄담한방병원</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">3</span><span>명일역4번출구.명일전통시장</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">4</span><span>사랑플러스병원건강증진센터</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">5</span><span>성덕중고등학교</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">6</span><span>성덕중고등학교</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">7</span><span>명일1동주민센터</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">8</span><span>명일1동주민센터</span></li></ol></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 버스</h3><dl class=\"kd-buses\"><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">간선</span></dt><dd><span>N30(심야)</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">지선</span></dt><dd><span>2312A</span><span>2312B</span><span>3321</span><span>3413</span><span>3318</span><span>3411</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">공항</span></dt><dd><span>6300</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\"